1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I’ve found Endre’s parents in the 1801 census. Your records say his parents married 1797 – Tharald Endresen Hetland (born 1776) and Barbro Larsdtr Hauo (1782). So, in the 1801 census they should be 25 and 19. Scrol
2 CONC l down to entries #025-031. They’re all living in household number 03. 25 is Tharald, married to 26 Maria. Ignore #27. He might be related or might just be a worker on the farm. #28 is konens fader (wife’s father – 026 Maria’s fat
2 CONC her). 29 is hans kone (his wife) and begge 1ste ægteskab means “both first marriage,” so Ingeborg has to be the mother of 026 Maria. Then 030 Thollach Larsen, 95 years old, is Enkemand (widower). He is konens farfader (wife’s fath
2 CONC er’s father). He’s the father of 028 Lars and the grandfather of 026 Maria.
2 CONT
2 CONT 031 Barbro is Enke (widow), so she’s not married to #030. Mandens moder means “man’s mother,” but which man? She can’t be the mother of 030 (who’s older than her). And she can’t be the mother of 028 Lars, because then she’d have t
2 CONC o be the wife of #030. She must be the mother of 025 Tharald. Which matches your records, where she’s called Maria Larsdr Hauo.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.digitalarkivet.no/census/person/pf01058349002363
