1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Etnesoga V page 229 Mittun u. Sande (22c).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg (Belle) Serena Noram was born in Etne, Norway and emigrated with her parents in 1881 to Morris, Illinois. She married James Wing and moved with him to their homestead near Somers, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT To this union, eight children were born.
2 CONT
2 CONT After her husband became hospitalized and later died in 1932, she lived on her farm north of Jackson, MN, with her son James Blaine and family, spending winters with son Joseph Eli in St Paul until her death in 1938.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/20343630/ingeborg-serena-wing
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg Serena “Belle” Noram Wing BIRTH	18 Apr 1879 Hordaland fylke, Norway DEATH	10 Aug 1938 (aged 59) Saint Paul, Ramsey County, Minnesota, USA BURIAL	 Our Saviour Cemetery Callender, Webster County, Iowa, USA
