1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/185886504/helen-olson
2 CONT
2 CONT Helen Norem Olson BIRTH	7 Jun 1890 Morris, Grundy County, Illinois, USA DEATH	14 Nov 1987 (aged 97) Rockford, Winnebago County, Illinois, USA BURIAL	 Arlington Memorial Park Cemetery Rockford, Winnebago County, Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Helen Olson, 97, Cherry Valley, died Sat., Nov. 14, 1987, in River Bluff Nursing Home after a lengthy illness. Born June 7, 1890, in Morris, the daughter of Ole and Julia Norem. Lived in Rockford since 1948. Married Otto C. Hagen 
2 CONC in Morris in 1908; he died in 1917. Married Thorvald Olson in Minnesota in 1919; he died in 1955. Member of Our Savor's Lutheran Church for 38 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include four sons, Otto Hagen, Kenneth, Herbert and Thorvald Olson; three daughters, Mrs. Jean Hagen Frye, Mrs. Nevina Monson, and Mrs. Alice Nordstrom; 19 grandchildren, 29 great-grandchildren; 5 great-great-grandchildr
2 CONC en. Also predeceased by her brothers and sisters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto Hagen 1886–1917 (m. 1908)
2 CONT
2 CONT Thorvald Olson 1887–1955 (m. 1919)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Jurine C. Hagen Frye 1913–1999
2 CONT
2 CONT Herbert J. Olson 1924–2006
2 CONT
