1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Ole had lost both his father(who died 28/4.1898) and his last stepmother, Marta Marie (who died 25/11.1899) he felt lonely. Christmas Eve in 1900, after giving presents to his half sisters and brothers (Ingrid
2 CONC  got a doll), he went out , along the harbour, probably having some drinks, and fall in the sea and drowned. They found him the next morning. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 01.09.1886 reiste han med seilskuten Barken "Sea" fra Egersund trolig til Amerika
2 CONT 02.03.1894 Reiste han med Seilskuten Barken "Leif" fra Stavanger til Amerika retur 09.11.1894 til Egersund
2 CONT 25.06.1895 Reiste med Seilskuten Barken "Løining" fra Egersund til Canada retur 07.11.1895
2 CONT
2 CONT Egersund mønstringskrets, AV/SAK-2031-0019/F/Fa/L0001: Annotasjonsrulle nr 1-1440 med register, O-1, 1869-1895, s. 169
2 CONT Brukslenke for sidevisning: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ru20090316750319
