2 NOTE I would like to post any old pictures oln my genealogy but have tapped the resources on the Brandsberg side for what they have.
2 NOTE We are related through Ole. I have more information available on  www.normasells.com/genealogy, then look at Brandsberg side of family.
3 CONT
3 CONT I have the books Hetland Skipreide books 1 and 2 until August 21 by Petrus Valand and Olav Heskestad. I have been try to get a copy for over a year.
3 CONT
3 CONT We also have more information from a genealogy done for someone in the Eia family in 1951 by Olav Heskestad.
3 CONT
3 CONT I am making copies of the information. I can read the basics, born, died, marriage, children, some occupatrions etc, but cannot read the stories enclosed in the books.
3 CONT
3 CONT At some point someone may help me do this, but here in Virginia there are not a lot of native Norwegian speakers.
2 NOTE Norma,
3 CONT Lars Thorsen and Guri Loyning pictures are on file but no picture of Ole Toresen. I will contact my cousins in Norway to see if they have any pictures.
2 NOTE Do you have a picture of her father Lars or mother Guri or her brother Ola?
