1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial record:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/124511355/endre-tharaldsen-hetland
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Tarald baptize #9:
2 CONT
2 CONT Rogaland county, Heskestad in Lund, Helleland, Parish register (copy) no. B 1 (1815-1853), Born and baptised 1829, Page 48 Quick link: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070103360441 Permanent image-link: http://urn.digitalarkivet.
2 CONC no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20070103360441.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT As a new member to this group, I am requesting assistance with the info listed in bold print. Here’s the overview of what I know about my 2nd great grandfather, Endre Therald Hetland born 02 Nov 1812, married to Martha Sophia Segl
2 CONC em in 1854 in Winneshiek County, Iowa. They came to the US as an unmarried couple with their 9-year old daughter, Marie Kessa Hetland, in 1854 on the ship Urda.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref. Name Age Sex Remarks Addition: Read or submit by clicking the names
2 CONT
2 CONT ID 1057681 Endre Hetland With 1 daughter 9 years old, Stavanger
2 CONT
2 CONT ID 1057692 Marthe Sophie Seglem Stavanger
2 CONT
2 CONT When Endre "Andrew" Tharaldsen Hetland was born on November 2, 1812, in Heskestad, Rogaland, Norway, his father, Tharald, was 36 and his mother, Maria, was 30. They had a total of 11 children between Norway and the US. Endre Hetla
2 CONC nd died on May 3, 1892, in Clear Lake, Iowa, having lived a long life of 79 years, and was buried in Cerro Gordo County, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Endre’s wife, Martha Sophia Seglem, was born Oct 7, 1818 in Avaldsnes, Rogaland, Norway but nothing is known about her parents. She died Oct 17, 1890 in Clear Lake, Cerro Gordo County, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Endre’s father was Tharald Endresen Hetland (born June 2, 1776 in Heskestad, Rogaland County, Norway to Endre Taraldson Hetland and Barbro Larsdtr Hauo. Tharald married 16, Dec 1797 in Heskestad, Norway to Maria Larsdr Hauo, who w
2 CONC as born Sept 8, 1782 in (city is unknown) Norway but parents are unknown. Maria Larsdr Hauo died July 15, 1851 in Hetland, Heskestad, Rogaland County, Norway and Tharald died July 8, 1851 also in Hetland, Heskestad.
2 CONT
2 CONT I have little info on their children born in Norway although I have more on those born in the US:
2 CONT
2 CONT Tharald Endresen Hetland, born 17 Mar 1829 in Hetland, Heskestad
2 CONT
2 CONT Tarl Jona Hetland, born 12 Jan 1833 in Christiana, Oslo County
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernt Benjamin “Ben” Gabriel Hetland, born 25 Dec 1839 in Stravanger
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Kessa Hetland, born in 1843 in __ Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Another side of my family (Skow) came from Vestre Toten, Oppland County, Norway but I will address that once I get more information on the Hetland side of the family. I have family tree maker software and have the worldwide versio
2 CONC n of ancestry.com but am just now learning how to research in Norway. Mange takk! Paula Seeger
