1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Holte passed to his home beyond last Thursday (7/23/1925) at the age of 23 years. Funeral services were conducted from the house and Bloomfield Church on Sunday afternoon, Rev. Eng, Rev. Berg, and also Mr. 
2 CONC Chrn of Redwing Seminary spoke. The Satertsdahl and Bloomfield choirs furnished the singing. The community at large sustained a great loss in the passing of this fine loving Christian young man. We extend our tenderest sympathies 
2 CONC to the sorrowing ones.  Preston Times Fillmore Minnesota July 30, 1925.
