1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Oliver Julian Wing was born in 1905. He farmed with his father, James, until he left the farm to attend mechanics school. He worked as a welder as well. In 1940, he married Aletta Anderson and to this union, three 
2 CONC children were born.
2 CONT
