2 NOTE Correct names of people in this photo:
3 CONT Gerhardine - Ludvig - Martha Marie - Lars -  Ingrid.
3 CONT The Refsland family  in their home in Elvegaten in Egersund  circa 1897.  Picture taken before Gerhardine married August Aslaksen.
3 CONT Lars Refsland died 28.april 1898 and Martha Marie (his 4th wife) died 25. november 1899.  Ludvig was born in 1890 and Ingrid in 1892.  (Guri is not at the photo - she was the 3rd wife of Lars Refsland and died in 1886.  She was th
3 CONC e mother of Gerhardine and Hans.) Comments added by Anne-Marie (daughter of Ingrid).
