1 RFN geni:6000000013757866305
1 SUBM @S6000000000167551348@
1 NOTE Gabriel var som fedrene sine ein valvyrd mann, og han hadde mange tillittsyrke. M.A. var utskiftingamann, Ordforer 1884-87.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ved Olav Heskestad genealogy 1951
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabriel operated the Eia Farm  from 1875-1920. He was also a politician and chaired the Board of the Sokndal community for four years. 
