1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ben bodde med familien på idylliske Camano Island nord for Seattle.  Han var pådriver for å få etablert en "state park" her, som man kan finne under i artikkelen fra Kitsap Sun.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sitat:  "There are numerous parks on Camano, but the largest, which gets the most foot traffic, is Camano Island State Park. This is a gem of a playground for hiking, fishing, camping, picnicking and boating. Ben Sollie, one of th
2 CONC e organizers of the petition to create the park, once wrote of the place: "The fishing is good, the clams delicious and the waterfront is easy on a fellow's feet.""
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.kitsapsun.com/lifestyle/camano-island-one-of-the-northwests-best-kept-secrets-ep-422592784-358790281.html
