2 CONT
2 CONT The following information was provided by FAG contributor M. Jensen Seggerman:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabe Soma, 75, died at his home last Sunday, December 18.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Soma was born in Norway February 28, 1885.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services were held on Wednesday, December 21 from the Farmer Funeral Home, with Rev. Harold Dodson officiating. Burial was in Exeter Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pallbearers were Joe Kolar, Nick Weis, Paul Becker, Leo Gibbons, Edward Votipka and Leo P. Murphy.
2 CONT
